  "description": "Image-codec facade over the Sdcb.SimdCodecs family: sniff a byte stream's format by its magic-byte signature and dispatch to the matching decoder (PNG, JPEG, TIFF, JBIG2, JPEG 2000, WebP, GIF), returning a codec-neutral IDecodedImage (fidelity tier: native bit depth + ColorEncoding colour signalling, with a ToFloats() RGBA float32 view) or decoding zero-copy into a caller-provided 8-bit RGBA buffer (display tier, integer-sample formats). AOT-compatible.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
